</span>
 <span>RDS ContextDB快速入门</span>
</div></div><div class="Header--title--iTk2tUo"><h1>RDS ContextDB快速入门</h1><div class="Header--actionBar--dvzFYrk"><div class="Header--left--x8TGxDL"><span class="Header--updateTime--YXGPhcZ">更新时间：</span></div><div class="Header--right--l4TSW1E"><span class="Header--copyButtonWrapper--LDbniON"><span class="CopyAsMarkdown--copyButton--SVGoWIG"><span role="img" class="Icon--icon--jErARdR"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 32 32" focusable="false" color="currentColor" fill="currentColor" class="" data-icon="copy"><g fill-rule="evenodd" stroke-width="1"><polygon fill-rule="nonzero" points="8 6.80000019 8 4 28 4 28 24 25 24 25 22 26 22 26 6 10 6 10 6.80000019"></polygon><path d="M24,8 L24,28 L4,28 L4,8 L24,8 Z M22,10 L6,10 L6,26 L22,26 L22,10 Z"></path></g></svg></span>复制 MD 格式</span></span><div class="Header--linkButton--LpCRs1O"><div class="OuterUrl--outUrl--ZFzJIhk"><a href="https://www.aliyun.com/product/rds" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">产品详情</a></div></div><div class="Contact--contactButton--TBwTX5R"><span class="Contact--favoritesBtn--J8mRVBp" title="收藏本文档" data-spm-click="gostr=/aliyun;locaid=collect"><i class="help-iconfont help-icon-like"></i></span><a href="/my_favorites.html">我的收藏</a></div></div></div></div></header><div class="pc-markdown-container unionContainer" id="pc-markdown-container"><div class="markdown-body"><div lang="zh" class="icms-help-docs-content">
<main id="main-3276066"><p id="3771f3bab6jsk" data-tag="shortdesc" class="shortdesc">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>是一款面向<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>的企业级上下文数据库服务，<b>支持<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Qoder、QoderWork、Claude Code、Codex、OpenClaw、OpenCode、Hermes<span class="help-letter-space"></span>和千问办公快速接入</b>。其不再仅仅关注数据的静态保存，而是将存储的核心重构为<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>提供高效、结构化、可理解的上下文供给，提供涵盖多源接入、提炼与资产化、检索与组合、治理与演进、权限控制及面向<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>服务化供给的统一<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Context<span class="help-letter-space"></span>生命周期管理。
    </p><div data-tag="body" id="body-qs-main-ctx01" class="body"><section id="section-bg-ctx02" class="section"><h2 id="h2-bg-ctx03"><b>功能简介</b></h2><section id="5909e6ebb6jtw" class="section"><h4 id="892420bf4d15s"><b>上下文管理难题</b></h4><p uuid="mpm0vidde6uw9n1q9qo" id="60e08e2329u01">随着 Agent 从"对话工具"逐步演进为真正能够持续执行任务的智能体，传统依赖本地会话和短期上下文的方式，已经无法满足企业级场景需求。</p><p uuid="mpm0vidd9jlfehw915u" id="41f360c83anes">在真实业务中，Agent 不仅需要理解当前问题，更需要持续记住<b>历史任务进度</b>、<b>关键决策过程</b>、<b>多 Agent 协作状态</b>、<b>长周期项目经验</b>、<b>企业知识与运行上下文等信息</b>。这些上下文往往分散在不同设备、不同系统和不同 Agent 之间，缺乏统一沉淀、共享与治理能力，导致 Agent 无法形成真正的长期记忆与持续进化能力。</p><p uuid="ms4dmglxb8a1gt8eh6j" id="2d88067ec0os4">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>通过<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Context Growth Loop<span class="help-letter-space"></span>的"记录—组织—召回与组合—执行反馈—评估演进"闭环链路，解决会话、文档、业务数据和执行反馈分散存储、难以持续积累、缺乏业务语义以及无法安全复用和统一治理的问题，持续提升 Context 的质量和复用价值，服务于建设企业级<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>和多<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>协作平台的企业及 Agent 应用开发者。</p></section><section id="089a348df0g32" class="section"><h4 uuid="mpniyrmarylng7nws3i" id="4cf7a0643crr1"><b>RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>核心优势</b></h4><p id="p-bg-def-ctx05">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>是一款面向<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>的企业级上下文数据库服务，支持主流平台（Qoder、QoderWork、Claude Code、Codex、OpenClaw、OpenCode、Hermes<span class="help-letter-space"></span>和千问办公）快速接入。其将记忆与知识管理重构为可被<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>直接消费的上下文供给，通过统一的上下文存储、协同共享、生命周期管理与智能检索能力，让 Agent 从"单次会话记忆"，进化为"具备长期记忆、持续协作与经验沉淀能力"的系统服务。</p><p id="e34e31b81aksz">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>具备以下核心能力：</p><ul id="ul-bg-caps-ctx06"><li id="li-bg-pluggable-ctx07"><p id="p-bg-pluggable-ctx08"><b>即开即用、快速接入：</b>支持短期记忆、长期记忆与知识库等能力，通过<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API&nbsp;Key<span class="help-letter-space"></span>丝滑对接各类<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent（包括通过自然语言或命令行分钟级接入，支持钉钉、飞书文档同步），实现按需调用，架构更轻、更灵活。</p></li><li id="li-bg-smart-ctx09"><p id="p-bg-smart-ctx10"><b>智能上下文管理：</b>上下文以图谱形式进行结构化存储，支持实时增量更新与复杂关系推理；通过“夜间服务”完成上下文演进，解决上下文的冗余与冲突问题。</p></li><li id="li-bg-share-ctx11"><p id="p-bg-share-ctx12"><b>跨<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>共享与企业级权限：</b>不同<span class="help-letter-space"></span>workspace<span class="help-letter-space"></span>之间权限隔离，同一<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API Key<span class="help-letter-space"></span>的<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Context<span class="help-letter-space"></span>可以在多个<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>间共享。支持工作空间开启高级权限模式，精细化配置知识库级别的用户访问权限。</p></li><li id="li-bg-govern-ctx13"><p id="p-bg-govern-ctx14"><b>统一管理：</b>继承<span class="help-letter-space"></span>RDS<span class="help-letter-space"></span>企业级高可用、高可靠与权限隔离能力。</p></li></ul></section></section><section id="3be108103e7ql" props="china" data-cond-props="china" class="section"><h2 id="9f4287d9802q7"><b>计费说明</b></h2><p id="e89780824fu44">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>采用按量付费模式，根据实际使用的资源量计费。ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>计费项包含两大类：</p><ul id="f01e42c0485nz"><li id="9f783baf07uwc"><p id="da23f77851woh"><b>记忆和知识的写入、检索、演进费用：</b>记忆写入/检索、知识写入/检索、上下文演进等调用大模型和计算资源产生的消耗，按<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credit<span class="help-letter-space"></span>计费。</p></li><li id="b9f378dac6w9r"><p id="41ccee0fb7560"><b>存储费用：</b>数据（含知识原文、记忆、知识索引等）存储产生的费用，按存储空间用量（GB/小时）计费。</p></li></ul><table id="be6368bb6eepv" tablewidth="100" tablecolswidth="9.75 12.96 18.29 42.91 16.090000000000003" autofit="true" class="table"><colgroup colwidth="0.49*" style="width:9.75%"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth="0.65*" style="width:12.96%"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth="0.91*" style="width:18.29%"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth="2.15*" style="width:42.91%"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth="0.8*" style="width:16.09%"></colgroup><tbody class="tbody"><tr id="0c1a7f7f76dws"><td id="b22b3ecbd6b77" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="3e8d074088ssr"><b>费用大类</b></p></td><td id="d9eed9a7039ar" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="5e57cecd12psn"><b>计费项名称</b></p></td><td id="31c437bb5eqv1" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="d84b0b3b33zh7"><b>计费项<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Code</b></p></td><td id="50f4953c7d1cw" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="dffd7b610555e"><b>计费说明</b></p></td><td id="8d8d4e7e6dbml" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="7d180f00c4rgx"><b>单价</b></p></td></tr><tr id="0b256303abtck"><td id="c2f8065e5cu0x" rowspan="5" colspan="1"><p id="716662d930sma">记忆和知识写入/检索</p></td><td id="c1995847fegik" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="47480da4fe9vv">记忆写入</p></td><td id="fe3526dd645wo" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="a0fb07a70bqqv"><code data-tag="code" id="b7a93b7b00ca0" class="code">contextdb_mem_add_requests</code></p></td><td id="6486528d90p1k" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="45c8a73cf6n8f">用户写入记忆过程产生的费用，按<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credit<span class="help-letter-space"></span>计费</p></td><td id="542e896a11s0u" rowspan="5" colspan="1"><p id="d458afc1d40vz">1<span class="help-letter-space"></span>元/Credit</p></td></tr><tr id="3acffc9228s14"><td id="0b162dc8eff6o" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="3a5acb2ec2s9m">记忆检索</p></td><td id="77f5307454xdv" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="0718727d1fa3h"><code data-tag="code" id="ac35d7c96azl9" class="code">contextdb_mem_retrieval</code></p></td><td id="62ff1d33e9vpg" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="883722b16fbz4">检索记忆过程产生的费用，按<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credit<span class="help-letter-space"></span>计费</p></td></tr><tr id="ca543267465vz"><td id="c7bb6b3a7e8uj" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="c8ecc9f22b1pj">知识写入</p></td><td id="0c498d526b0oj" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="7e4cf207c25z8"><code data-tag="code" id="68bcd0bfba16d" class="code">contextdb_rag_add_requests</code></p></td><td id="ab1f3ea326uzd" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="0f0a099b1aiou">用户写入知识（含多模态）过程产生的费用，按<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credit<span class="help-letter-space"></span>计费</p></td></tr><tr id="63756b4b95pfp"><td id="637635bb629t7" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="af3b91fba0h4u">知识检索</p></td><td id="c2d836da3f3ta" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="376489cf14nf4"><code data-tag="code" id="b9ef02dec24n2" class="code">contextdb_rag_retrieval</code></p></td><td id="364e8b5608knz" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="7a381cc7a72sy">检索知识过程产生的费用，按<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credit<span class="help-letter-space"></span>计费</p></td></tr><tr id="937e6a1d51vu4"><td id="d544e6b6a12ki" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="e2b3c03c9003h">上下文演进</p></td><td id="12cd08225cj6d" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="69279c63d8pes"><code data-tag="code" id="876dc634984qf" class="code">context_growth</code></p></td><td id="4ec6c41055t7k" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="40238c4b90n1n">记忆晋升、知识评审过程产生的费用，按<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credit<span class="help-letter-space"></span>计费</p></td></tr><tr id="3936f2df05uro"><td id="a833815ffe8t7" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><p id="2824aa6c33nf4">存储</p></td><td id="e925fc604eh8s" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="7ee9af5027xib">源存储空间</p></td><td id="d2d401356ef3m" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><p id="018a3a22a08jf"><code data-tag="code" id="860b0b5411sua" class="code">agent_service_storage</code></p></td><td id="1068f7de2b3dq" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="f49bac851d6pc">知识原文占用的存储空间，按用量（GB/小时）计费</p></td><td id="f17d7a6b3aojo" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="bada6c313a0xt">0.00017<span class="help-letter-space"></span>元/GB/小时</p></td></tr><tr id="935268214002z"><td id="7b353d03bbhtw" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="8eaa1eedbdmsu">上下文存储空间</p></td><td id="3139654c72pad" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="382d40382e8xi">记忆、知识索引占用的存储空间，按用量（GB/小时）计费</p></td><td id="0ea5f5de3492m" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="b120017e98hq3">0.0021<span class="help-letter-space"></span>元/GB/小时</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="p-credit-pack01"><b>您可以购买<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credits<span class="help-letter-space"></span>包抵扣「记忆和知识写入/检索」产生的费用，但不支持抵扣存储费用</b>：</p><ul id="ul-credit-pack02"><li id="li-credit-buy03"><p id="p-credit-buy04"><b>购买方式：</b>您可以通过<span class="help-letter-space"></span><a href="https://common-buy.aliyun.com/subscription/addon?productUnitCode=rds_agent_db_service&amp;subscriptionCode=rds_agent_db_service_contextdb_pack" id="a-credit-buy05" class="" target="_blank">Credits<span class="help-letter-space"></span>包购买页</a>购买<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credits<span class="help-letter-space"></span>包，可选额度规格以购买页为准。</p></li><li id="li-credit-expire06"><p id="p-credit-expire07"><b>有效期：</b>单个<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credits<span class="help-letter-space"></span>包有效期为<span class="help-letter-space"></span>1<span class="help-letter-space"></span>个月，到期后未使用完的额度将自动失效。</p></li><li id="li-credit-refund08"><p id="p-credit-refund09"><b>退订说明：</b>Credits<span class="help-letter-space"></span>包不支持退订。</p></li></ul><div type="note" id="ea01c12abe69z" class="note note-note"><div class="note-icon-wrapper"><i class="icon-note note note"></i></div><div class="noteContentSpan"><strong>说明 </strong><p id="9de8f448eerrk">2026<span class="help-letter-space"></span>年<span class="help-letter-space"></span>09<span class="help-letter-space"></span>月<span class="help-letter-space"></span>20<span class="help-letter-space"></span>日至<span class="help-letter-space"></span>2026<span class="help-letter-space"></span>年<span class="help-letter-space"></span>11<span class="help-letter-space"></span>月<span class="help-letter-space"></span>30<span class="help-letter-space"></span>日期间，ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>新用户（已通过阿里云实名认证）开通后，可<a class="" href="https://www.aliyun.com/activity/database/contextdb" id="8fe28916e7yv5">免费领取<span class="help-letter-space"></span>834<span class="help-letter-space"></span>元免费权益</a>（含<span class="help-letter-space"></span>799<span class="help-letter-space"></span>元<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Credits<span class="help-letter-space"></span>包和<span class="help-letter-space"></span>35<span class="help-letter-space"></span>元存储空间抵扣券），同一用户仅限参与一次。</p></div></div></section><section id="section-limit-ctx15" class="section"><h2 id="h2-limit-ctx16"><b>使用限制</b></h2><ul id="ul-limit-ctx18"><li id="li-limit-agent-ctx23"><p id="p-limit-agent-ctx24"><b>主流平台快速接入：</b>支持<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Qoder、QoderWork、Claude Code、Codex、OpenClaw、OpenCode、Hermes<span class="help-letter-space"></span>和千问办公快速接入，其他平台可以通过<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API、MCP<span class="help-letter-space"></span>等方式配置接入。</p></li><li id="li-limit-memory-ctx25"><p id="p-limit-memory-ctx26"><b>记忆共享：</b>同一<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>下（含跨<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Session）的记忆可共享，记忆数据暂不支持导出。</p></li><li id="li-limit-kb-ctx27"><p id="p-limit-kb-ctx28"><b>知识库：</b>同一<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Workspace<span class="help-letter-space"></span>内成员可共享知识库内容（通过知识库内容共享，可以实现跨<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>的业务背景共享）。当前支持通过控制台、命令行或在<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>内通过对话的方式上传知识文档，暂不支持知识库导出。</p></li><li id="li-limit-isolation-ctx29"><p id="p-limit-isolation-ctx30"><b>记忆隔离：</b>不同成员之间记忆内容互相隔离，同一成员下不同<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API Key<span class="help-letter-space"></span>不隔离。</p></li><li id="fa4e2cd0fcozr"><p id="67b95ceefdw0n"><b>RAM<span class="help-letter-space"></span>子账号限制：</b>如使用<span class="help-letter-space"></span>RAM<span class="help-letter-space"></span>子账号访问<span class="help-letter-space"></span>ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>控制台，需要主账号先开通<span class="help-letter-space"></span>ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>服务并创建<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Workspace。</p></li></ul></section><section id="section-step1-ctx75" class="section"><h2 id="h2-step1-ctx76"><b>步骤一：开通<span class="help-letter-space"></span>RDS ContextDB</b></h2><ol id="941651ada92ks"><li id="479259aa82gvo"><p id="762ecde367ihl">进入<span class="help-letter-space"></span><a href="https://rdsnext.console.aliyun.com/" id="a-console-e1-ctx88" class="" target="_blank">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>页面</a>。</p></li><li id="9251cfa164inh"><p id="fa5d2f9f802y2">单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="ac14d0194b408" class="uicontrol">开通<span class="help-letter-space"></span>RDS ContextDB</b>。<span data-tag="ph" id="b3dabafba7vym" props="china" data-cond-props="china" class="ph">如您之前为公测用户，可以单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="98e0de1500th2" class="uicontrol">正式开通</b>，继续使用<span class="help-letter-space"></span>ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>功能。</span></p></li></ol></section><section id="73395bc056zl4" class="section"><h2 id="fca164f016e5e"><b>步骤二：创建与配置工作空间</b></h2><p id="fd783f2a20oda">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>开通成功后，您可以创建一个工作空间作为上下文、记忆与知识库的逻辑集合，并为工作空间创建访问凭证<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API Key，用于客户端身份认证。</p><ol id="8daa0aab4duof"><li id="91d02e560165a"><p id="2e737789738j5">进入<span class="help-letter-space"></span><a href="https://rdsnext.console.aliyun.com/" id="d87aade9c4s92" class="" target="_blank">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>页面</a>。</p></li><li id="4f104bf732vwt"><p id="cb80e9fb88lss">单击<b id="8651185f6dedm" data-tag="uicontrol" data-isbold="true" class="uicontrol">新建</b>按钮并在弹窗中填写<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="fe15a7c95d6ex" class="uicontrol">工作空间名称</b>与<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="b6152ace8bjjz" class="uicontrol">初始管理员名称</b>并单击确定。</p></li><li id="da4286f241k21"><p id="05b31f536bwy5">API Key<span class="help-letter-space"></span>将会自动生成。<b>请立即妥善保存 API Key，关闭后将无法再次查看，</b>单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="1796db7b7e5fl" class="uicontrol">我已保存</b>。</p></li></ol><div type="note" id="395743bf8f6o5" props="china" data-cond-props="china" class="note note-note"><div class="note-icon-wrapper"><i class="icon-note note note"></i></div><div class="noteContentSpan"><strong>说明 </strong><p id="3a654dc638sen">您也可以直接通过<span class="help-letter-space"></span>OpenAPI<span class="help-letter-space"></span>操作<span class="help-letter-space"></span>ContextDB，详情请参见<span class="help-letter-space"></span><a href="#section-related-relctx01" id="f4fef35c84jyp" title="" class="xref">RDS ContextDB API<span class="help-letter-space"></span>参考</a>。</p></div></div></section><section id="577f849ff9n6p" class="section"><h2 id="df3001cd79xuo"><b>步骤三：安装与连接<span class="help-letter-space"></span>ContextDB</b></h2><p id="7a05a817355n0">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>支持<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Qoder、QoderWork、Claude Code、Codex、OpenClaw、OpenCode、Hermes<span class="help-letter-space"></span>和千问办公等主流平台快速接入（其他平台需要手动配置）。</p><div type="note" id="ddf930f34fwej" class="note note-note"><div class="note-icon-wrapper"><i class="icon-note note note"></i></div><div class="noteContentSpan"><strong>说明 </strong><p id="8c950a4bb9zov">以下安装方式中<code data-tag="code" id="e55c64f35bmu7" class="code">&lt;API_KEY&gt;</code>均需替换为您在上一步中保存的<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API Key。</p></div></div><section id="5209445eac1ag" class="section"><h3 id="c3893c911ft4k"><b>方式一：通过自然语言接入</b></h3><p id="f59bd3e546u0n">复制以下文本并发送给您的<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent，通过<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>自动完成安装与接入。</p><pre code-type="xCode" id="e1e0355a3c5u7" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-plaintext" class="pre codeblock language-plaintext"><code>请阅读 https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.md，按照脚本说明安装 ctxdb CLI，并使用 API Key &lt;API_KEY&gt; 为你自己完成接入配置。</code></pre></section><section id="7e409d9848sf7" class="section"><h3 id="2fd2d0079fchh"><b>方式二：通过命令行接入</b></h3><section id="e7dac3922fv1k" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="ee68264277ohr" class="section"><h2 id="fee14fd4e1e7h">Qoder</h2><section id="999aef911ftbs" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="71b53f19d7viz" class="section"><h2 id="9c7773d0dbz0l">Linux/macOS/WSL</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="2762292a0131o" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code>curl -fsSL 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.sh' | bash -s -- --agent qoder --api-key &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section><section id="548598d3bb7f4" class="section"><h2 id="d157da8a069ay">Windows PowerShell</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="29aca9e2devuz" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-powershell" class="pre codeblock language-powershell"><code>&amp; ([ScriptBlock]::Create((irm 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.ps1'))) -Agent qoder -ApiKey &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section></section></section><section id="c56aeeece5wio" class="section"><h2 id="182f183e39zob">Claude</h2><section id="b3810b45f0dm2" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="41385dd6486md" class="section"><h2 id="93df95e393seo">Linux/macOS/WSL</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="72ef7843eayxj" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code>curl -fsSL 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.sh' | bash -s -- --agent claude --api-key &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section><section id="b431fa88d4xca" class="section"><h2 id="3aeec2c55b416">Windows PowerShell</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="3f2574626c4jg" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-powershell" class="pre codeblock language-powershell"><code>&amp; ([ScriptBlock]::Create((irm 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.ps1'))) -Agent claude -ApiKey &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section></section></section><section id="38bf6479fcn0p" class="section"><h2 id="4d9fa45547p7b">Codex</h2><section id="30d5efa806fny" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="9e29115d99372" class="section"><h2 id="e2eab9b6e0efz">Linux/macOS/WSL</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="cc9a51eb4b05w" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code>curl -fsSL 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.sh' | bash -s -- --agent codex --api-key &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section><section id="4ae509a595op6" class="section"><h2 id="d791bd7364f6d">Windows PowerShell</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="6e36510332nth" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-powershell" class="pre codeblock language-powershell"><code>&amp; ([ScriptBlock]::Create((irm 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.ps1'))) -Agent codex -ApiKey &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section></section></section><section id="3b46f6f53ec2k" class="section"><h2 id="3f325bcb7brfe">OpenCode</h2><section id="cab37e67a0jui" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="3ec215bce14ch" class="section"><h2 id="ddf25737abxas">Linux/macOS/WSL</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="4618a35479s1i" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code>curl -fsSL 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.sh' | bash -s -- --agent opencode --api-key &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section><section id="d3ea91326ccnw" class="section"><h2 id="60b3e343fenwy">Windows PowerShell</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="d08140811419c" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-powershell" class="pre codeblock language-powershell"><code>&amp; ([ScriptBlock]::Create((irm 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.ps1'))) -Agent opencode -ApiKey &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section></section></section><section id="e81a6d84e2t1g" class="section"><h2 id="31a3f7f4876cl">OpenClaw</h2><section id="dd8a0be878y20" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="42a4e4109emoo" class="section"><h2 id="7ce9d7d789z8e">Linux/macOS/WSL</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="50fb25edeebr0" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code>curl -fsSL 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.sh' | bash -s -- --agent openclaw --api-key &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section><section id="7db1cfd7d9p6v" class="section"><h2 id="ef65d10b5f1y3">Windows PowerShell</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="a4aacfda81rx2" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-powershell" class="pre codeblock language-powershell"><code>&amp; ([ScriptBlock]::Create((irm 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.ps1'))) -Agent openclaw -ApiKey &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section></section></section><section id="d143f3ec18vb1" class="section"><h2 id="cb48d4865fayi">Hermes</h2><section id="a12d8df11cdoc" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="0c3edbdcb4x9s" class="section"><h2 id="6c18d671ee747">Linux/macOS/WSL</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="a28fb097195d6" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code>curl -fsSL 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.sh' | bash -s -- --agent hermes --api-key &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section><section id="a7259c720834w" class="section"><h2 id="f352e59e9cl3y">Windows PowerShell</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="5f999b68d4q43" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-powershell" class="pre codeblock language-powershell"><code>&amp; ([ScriptBlock]::Create((irm 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.ps1'))) -Agent hermes -ApiKey &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section></section></section><section id="b2baacdd70m5l" class="section"><h2 id="1c302f866dtup">QwenWork</h2><section id="630d21eb1ez6r" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="279231aa09a5h" class="section"><h2 id="75c0284edernn">Linux/macOS/WSL</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="b1cd32843b9yg" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code>curl -fsSL 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.sh' | bash -s -- --agent qwenwork --api-key &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section><section id="6f2f2a4e378h9" class="section"><h2 id="1a413a063777k">Windows PowerShell</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="de784f636axrp" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-powershell" class="pre codeblock language-powershell"><code>&amp; ([ScriptBlock]::Create((irm 'https://context-database-client.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/install.ps1'))) -Agent qwenwork -ApiKey &lt;API_KEY&gt;</code></pre></section></section></section></section></section><section id="5e54e75c29zyf" class="section"><h3 id="c2ddc26bdeal1"><b>方式三：通过<span class="help-letter-space"></span>MCP<span class="help-letter-space"></span>接入</b></h3><ul id="421be39f965rt"><li id="7c8ba973f7ea8"><p id="4b8ac0bd990s2"><b>MCP<span class="help-letter-space"></span>服务地址</b></p><pre code-type="xCode" id="db81369696j4i" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-plaintext" class="pre codeblock language-plaintext"><code>https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/mcp</code></pre></li><li id="70d86695e9ogr"><p id="7d2d1f2df3pmh"><b>各应用配置</b></p></li></ul><section id="86db219d96bvf" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="53f3b1b29bog0" class="section"><h2 id="5f9b852d6dej1">Qoder</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="fe044b5fa9n9x" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-json" class="pre codeblock language-json"><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "contextdb": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer &lt;API_KEY&gt;"
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre></section><section id="1ac7b0c1ba5gx" class="section"><h2 id="495948dd6471y">Claude</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="b0d67c77a7dhy" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-json" class="pre codeblock language-json"><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "contextdb": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer &lt;API_KEY&gt;"
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre></section><section id="fa70e51df8q9n" class="section"><h2 id="babc8d1c85eax">Codex</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="0e5d3fc934tri" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-json" class="pre codeblock language-json"><code>[mcp_servers.contextdb]
url = "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/mcp"

[mcp_servers.contextdb.http_headers]
Authorization = "Bearer &lt;API_KEY&gt;"</code></pre></section><section id="0e0aa7308cj99" class="section"><h2 id="61dec7d54fre7">OpenCode</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="873948e8del32" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-json" class="pre codeblock language-json"><code>{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "mcp": {
    "contextdb": {
      "type": "remote",
      "url": "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/mcp",
      "oauth": false,
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer &lt;API_KEY&gt;"
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre></section><section id="2d8f307840kuq" class="section"><h2 id="677bd11c7f1bm">OpenClaw</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="b131cbc2bawze" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-json" class="pre codeblock language-json"><code>{
  "mcp": {
    "servers": {
      "contextdb": {
        "url": "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/mcp",
        "transport": "streamable-http",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer &lt;API_KEY&gt;"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre></section><section id="525b7d773bps2" class="section"><h2 id="96f280e8edoc2">Hermes</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="fa5d7dfab5sub" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-json" class="pre codeblock language-json"><code>mcp_servers:
  contextdb:
    url: "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/mcp"
    headers:
      Authorization: "Bearer &lt;API_KEY&gt;"</code></pre></section><section id="ce31ed8d572yq" class="section"><h2 id="dc1b67319clgf">QwenWork</h2><pre code-type="xCode" id="05beb503ee2gt" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-json" class="pre codeblock language-json"><code>{
  "mcpServers": {
    "contextdb": {
      "type": "streamable-http",
      "url": "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer &lt;API_KEY&gt;"
      }
    }
  }
}</code></pre></section></section></section></section><section id="section-step2-ctx136" class="section"><h2 id="h2-step2-ctx137"><b>核心功能</b></h2><p id="152182ee2f2a7">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>工作空间内提供概览、API Key<span class="help-letter-space"></span>管理、记忆、记忆晋升、知识库、用量与审计日志管理等核心能力。</p><section id="section-mod-home-ctx150" class="section"><h3 id="h3-mod-home-ctx151"><b>1. 空间总览</b></h3><p id="p-mod-home-desc-ctx152">空间总览页是<span class="help-letter-space"></span>RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>工作空间的首页，集中展示当前工作空间下的基本信息、额度用量和权限模式。</p><ul id="9bd275a6a8lke"><li id="li-mod-home-overview-ctx155"><p id="p-mod-home-overview-ctx156"><b>基本信息速览：</b>查看当前空间下记忆条数、知识库数量、待评审文档、待审核记忆晋升、工作空间名称与<span class="help-letter-space"></span>ID<span class="help-letter-space"></span>等基本信息。</p></li><li id="li-mod-home-install-ctx157"><p id="p-mod-home-install-ctx158"><b>高级权限：</b>单击<b>开启高级权限</b>，可以精细化配置知识库级别的用户访问权限。</p></li><li id="7a1c0ec2ef6f0"><p id="81f120f8cbxtq"><b>资源用量：</b>展示<span class="help-letter-space"></span>30<span class="help-letter-space"></span>天内知识库、记忆库的读写次数与源文件存储用量。</p></li></ul></section><section id="section-mod-memories-ctx172" class="section"><h3 id="h3-mod-memories-ctx173"><b>2. 上下文资产</b></h3><section id="308dd252f9keq" class="section"><h4 id="7860b7fc36v8v"><b>2.1 记忆</b></h4><p id="p-mod-memories-desc-ctx174">记忆事实是从对话中提取的客观信息片段，用于沉淀用户偏好、项目事实和工具经验。RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>通过结构化的方式（“ 事实 - 实体 - 记忆规则”）存储与管理<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>记忆：</p><ul id="ul-mod-memories-ctx175"><li id="li-mod-entities-ctx178"><p id="p-mod-entities-ctx179"><b>事实：</b>从上下文中拆解出的<b>原子化的陈述</b>（自洽短句），作为主要检索对象并向量化，召回时通常在这一层做语义命中。</p></li><li id="361819c0a3718"><p id="43d8e01938zw3"><b>实体：</b>高频出现的人、组织、项目、工具等，会沉淀为带属性、别名、重要性评分等内容的<b>常驻画像（Entity Card）</b>，并与后续写入的结论条目绑定，使会话重启时不从零铺垫背景。所有实体可构建<b>实体关系图谱，</b>通过可视化的方式展示实体间的联系。</p></li><li id="dbbbdae7bc0td"><p id="55f5ea40b5pxa"><b>记忆规则</b>：可以根据业务需要自定义成员的记忆。</p></li><li id="97b93c05dcv5f"><p id="28dc408c75q3p"><b>遗忘管理：</b>开启<b>自动遗忘</b>功能后，ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>根据<b>自定义的遗忘条件</b>与<b>召回情况，</b>自动遗忘不再活跃的记忆，并保护重要内容。</p></li></ul></section><section id="979611d060n05" class="section"><h4 id="661bc5140cq8b"><b>2.2 知识库</b></h4><p id="p-mod-kb-desc-ctx186">知识库模块用于管理工作空间内可被<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>检索的外部知识资源，您可以通过控制台、自然语言或<span class="help-letter-space"></span>CLI<span class="help-letter-space"></span>命令创建知识库、上传文档与召回知识：</p><div type="note" id="2a9fe5acb0p0n" props="china" data-cond-props="china" class="note note-note"><div class="note-icon-wrapper"><i class="icon-note note note"></i></div><div class="noteContentSpan"><strong>说明 </strong><p id="49c619865arq0">你也可以使用<span class="help-letter-space"></span><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/sync-data-to-rds-contextdb-from-dingtalk-feishu" id="c9213527408mo" title="" class="xref">ContextDB Sync</a><span class="help-letter-space"></span>工具，自动同步您的钉钉、飞书或本地数据至<span class="help-letter-space"></span>ContextDB。</p></div></div><section id="c98883f6b6mw1" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="d502524c5c5g4" class="section"><h2 id="fb32192407vsy">通过控制台管理</h2><ol id="0fd301a8c2h5v"><li id="54d4c168952z2"><p id="9033150b21dib">创建知识库</p><ol id="c8870c0016twu" data-init-id="0fd301a8c2h5v"><li id="d80f1e11c9adv"><p id="108f5a236f7ce">在导航栏中选择<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="4bda9a5bc7abk" class="uicontrol">知识库</b>，进入<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="aec595142cynz" class="uicontrol">知识库列表</b>。</p></li><li id="c9a7ed9935u8c"><p id="04af6954eebr0">单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="b5851dbda9gda" class="uicontrol">新建知识库</b>，输入<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="71f3f20055or3" class="uicontrol">名称</b>，选择是否开启<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="2e3e4bd2a8mwh" class="uicontrol">知识图谱</b>与<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="7f8e84a166swd" class="uicontrol">知识评审</b>，单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="60a9651b82zx7" class="uicontrol">确定</b>。</p><ul id="b9662e31b8uba"><li id="618e52a5d3xgj"><p id="6ea6810e69g9f"><b>知识图谱：</b>开启后，ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>会将非结构化或半结构化的知识转化为结构化的图谱数据，并在知识检索时返回图增强索引信息。</p></li><li id="f4aadab4ecwcu"><p id="0d067b7b63j8x"><b>知识评审：</b>开启后，当文档上传到知识库时，系统会自动进行质量评估、自矛盾检测和重写建议，并根据配置决定自动入库或人工审核。</p></li></ul></li></ol></li><li id="1f430e4ff26fb"><p id="407e1899e9ud7">上传文档</p><ol id="8110d2ac6e88s"><li id="c173c53e342g3"><p id="95f9602dbejvx">选择需要上传文档的目标知识库。</p></li><li id="c4f43b4559r96"><p id="bb8728934cpd4">单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="4dfb41864bc5b" class="uicontrol">上传文件</b>，根据需要勾选<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="43121e8f57zui" class="uicontrol">上传后进行知识评审</b>，选择文件后单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="a9f0acd272xb4" class="uicontrol">确定</b>。</p><ol id="e49a70d0cer64"><li id="3a0feaf6a1fpc"><p id="36e0b7acc7wjm">当入库状态变为<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="e1516d022frfd" class="uicontrol">成功</b>时，表示文档成功上传知识库。</p></li><li id="8ac889fae3v0u"><p id="5b6c34798eyoa">当入库状态变为<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="e1820d50dfo62" class="uicontrol">等待人工评审</b>时，您需要前往<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="329a0dd51fj7m" class="uicontrol">知识评审</b>页面进行人工审核。</p></li></ol></li></ol></li><li id="4bfcb4813cv5v"><p id="e864e5e879ufn">查看知识库图谱</p><ol id="a4d96c14802nj"><li id="25aaeea6ad9wd"><p id="98250c52b88mn">在导航栏中选择<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="4b5ab8ebd2mn7" class="uicontrol">知识库</b>，进入<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="1a691e0850mwr" class="uicontrol">知识图谱</b>界面。</p></li><li id="b68852e5d7w92"><p id="48423ba061177">查看图谱：查看知识库中实体间的联系，支持选定实体名称与文件范围进行检索。</p></li><li id="119dc20cadb3x"><p id="e37a64925bhwn">实体管理：查看当前知识库下所有实体，并支持手动添加实体。</p></li></ol></li></ol></section><section id="38cc0ade6915q" class="section"><h2 id="90fcfede41g5e">通过自然语言管理</h2><p id="ebf7744365gn5">接入 ContextDB 后，您可以直接用自然语言让 Agent 完成知识库操作，无需手写<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API。</p><ol id="725a8e7bd7z6t"><li id="1088e9b4d2vn8"><p id="583e3f83d8yj3">创建知识库</p><pre code-type="xCode" id="2c2d549ba9h3m" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-markdown" class="pre codeblock language-markdown"><code>帮我新建一个叫“Aliyun RDS MySQL 运维资料库”的知识库。</code></pre></li><li id="70ab84621cemv"><p id="3f3ac32e73x7z">上传文档</p><pre code-type="xCode" id="384b38de66l2l" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-markdown" class="pre codeblock language-markdown"><code>把 ~/docs/aliyun-rds-mysql-overview.pdf 上传到“Aliyun RDS MySQL 运维资料库”。</code></pre></li><li id="c41fc5a2a7dqx"><p id="7e06132c0c7qj">知识召回</p><pre code-type="xCode" id="5c70955ed3uz6" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-markdown" class="pre codeblock language-markdown"><code>结合“Aliyun RDS MySQL 运维资料库”，回答：当业务读请求量明显升高时，RDS MySQL 可以通过哪些能力扩展读取能力？只读实例和读写分离分别适合解决什么问题？</code></pre></li></ol></section><section id="47dcb10660t7x" class="section"><h2 id="d2b86958a5ea6">通过命令行管理</h2><ol id="516bb9ab80unj"><li id="61f915f094507"><p id="56a16e00e1e5s">创建知识库</p><pre code-type="xCode" id="a513b8e13ft0u" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code># 命令返回的<span class="help-letter-space"></span>id<span class="help-letter-space"></span>为<span class="help-letter-space"></span>kb_id，用于后续操作
curl -X POST "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/knowledge/knowledge_bases" \
  -H "Authorization: Token $API_KEY" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"name": "my-kb", "description": "测试知识库"}'</code></pre></li><li id="c6d9905ff1ies"><p id="06e0535c3ei86">上传文本文档或本地文件</p><pre code-type="xCode" id="cbec4aef2b384" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code># 上传文本文档
curl -X POST "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/knowledge/documents" \
  -H "Authorization: Token $API_KEY" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"knowledge_base_id": "'$KB_ID'", "name": "intro.md", "text": "文档全文内容……", "mime_type": "text/plain"}'
  
# 上传本地文件
curl -X POST "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/knowledge/files" \
  -H "Authorization: Token $API_KEY" \
  -F "knowledge_base_id=$KB_ID" \
  -F "file=@/path/to/your-doc.pdf"</code></pre></li><li id="dabe8cd6a8chh"><p id="a0cd203064tqi">知识召回</p><pre code-type="xCode" id="6d41070e9fm96" index="0" data-tag="codeblock" outputclass="language-zsh" class="pre codeblock language-zsh"><code># dataset_ids<span class="help-letter-space"></span>如果为空数组，则表示搜全部知识库
curl -X POST "https://context-database.aliyuncs.com/v1/knowledge/query" \
  -H "Authorization: Token $API_KEY" -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"question": "你想问的问题", "dataset_ids": [], "top_k": 6}'</code></pre></li></ol></section></section></section></section><section id="6c4b7cb8b5i1z" class="section"><h3 id="3235847075cbl"><b>3. 上下文演进</b></h3><section id="78fa922ea09g6" class="section"><h4 id="5f40a6a594gu9"><b>3.1 记忆整理</b></h4><ul id="cf4d719d4f19r"><li id="a370ce251bt62"><p id="8a31b4c52fl9v">自动整理：系统每天自动更新实体属性、归档冲突记忆、合并重复关系，并调整记忆热度与归档状态。</p></li><li id="15a942c27fvdz"><p id="311a1c44d5eyu">手动整理：单击<b>立即整理</b>即可发起一次整理任务。</p></li></ul></section><section id="section-memory-to-doc" class="section"><h4 id="h3-memory-to-doc"><b>3.2 记忆晋升</b></h4><p id="p-memory-to-doc-desc">记忆晋升支持记忆成文功能，其能将<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>使用过程中沉淀的记忆自动整理为团队可复用知识的能力。该功能不会简单拼接记忆，而是通过一组<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Agent<span class="help-letter-space"></span>角色协作，完成资料检索、事实校验、文档写作、质量审核和风险标记，将分散的经验转化为结构化、可审核、可沉淀的知识文档。</p><section id="section-mem-doc-create" class="section"><p id="h4-mem-doc-create"><b>新建晋升任务</b></p><ol id="ol-mem-doc-create"><li id="li-mem-create-step1"><p id="p-mem-create-step1">在导航栏中选择<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="ui-knowledge-promotion" class="uicontrol">记忆晋升</b>页面。</p></li><li id="561e6b0b1cp41"><p id="8b2af5354at8x"><b>（可选）晋升模板：</b>您可以用模板预设文件章节结构与撰写指引，让记忆自动晋升为符合团队规范、可审核的知识文件。</p></li><li id="li-mem-create-step2"><p id="p-mem-create-step2">单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="ui-new-promotion-task" class="uicontrol">新建晋升任务</b>，输入<b>晋升主题</b>，选择<b>晋升模板</b>（可选）与<b>目标知识库</b>。</p></li><li id="li-mem-create-step3"><p id="p-mem-create-step3">系统将根据记忆内容自动生成围绕该关键词的知识文档，等待生成完成后进入审批流程。</p></li></ol></section><section id="section-mem-doc-review" class="section"><p id="h4-mem-doc-review"><b>审批文档</b></p><p id="p-mem-doc-review-intro">对于状态为<b>待审核</b>的文档，在审批页面中，您可以：</p><ol id="ul-mem-review-actions"><li id="li-review-edit-title"><p id="p-review-edit-title"><b>编辑文档信息：</b>修改文档标题与内容。</p></li><li id="li-review-questions"><p id="p-review-questions"><b>处理疑问列表：</b>查看系统标记的待确认疑点（如事实冲突、证据不足等），按照选项进行选择或自定义答案。</p></li></ol><p id="p-mem-review-submit">完成修改后，您可以：</p><ul id="ul-mem-review-decisions"><li id="li-review-approve"><p id="p-review-approve">单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="ui-approve" class="uicontrol">批准</b><b data-tag="uicontrol" id="0c457fed0bxuj" class="uicontrol">入库</b>，文档将进入知识评审环节。</p></li><li id="li-review-reject"><p id="p-review-reject">单击<b data-tag="uicontrol" id="ui-reject" class="uicontrol">拒绝</b>，文档将被标记为不适合放入知识库。</p></li></ul><p id="f4b4389a42pym">当您有大量同质任务需要集中或自动化审批时，您可以：</p><ul id="a94aab117561z"><li id="536af938c782h"><p id="62ef6bbce9axz"><b>批量审批：</b>勾选任务，单击<b>批量通过</b>或<b>批量拒绝</b>。</p></li><li id="c2304220e4v86"><p id="8ead5d8323r90"><b>自动入库：</b>单击开启按钮，设置<b>质量分阈值</b>与<b>目标知识库</b>，单击<b>确定</b>。质量分大于或等于阈值的晋升文件将自动入库，低于阈值则进入人工审核（知识评审）。</p></li></ul></section></section><section id="a15c78ec3e0zk" class="section"><h4 id="8f94a727cdlzw"><b>3.3. 知识评审</b></h4><p id="c6e370953b4qo">当文件上传到知识库时，系统会自动进行质量评估、自矛盾检测、计算综合置信度，并做出入库决策：</p><ul id="968e806f1abwt"><li id="bfa8051851j2h"><p id="597b7fbe07kve"><b>自动通过：</b>置信度高于阈值且无幻觉，直接入库。</p></li><li id="d0589c1bd73g5"><p id="bd16e8a576dpw"><b>待人工审核：</b>当置信度低于阈值时，需要人工介入审核。您可以在<b>知识评审</b>页面，选择<b>待人工审核</b>的文档，查看评审详情，支持<b>拒绝</b>、<b>原样入库</b>或<b>采纳重写</b>。</p></li></ul><div type="important" id="49a5ac2208wjk" class="note note-important"><div class="note-icon-wrapper"><i class="icon-note note important"></i></div><div class="noteContentSpan"><strong>重要 </strong><p id="b928d59c689ff">当前文档评审仅支持<code data-tag="code" id="f331759e90m2m" class="code">txt/md/pdf/doc/docx</code>格式文档。</p></div></div></section><section id="a30ffa2507eb3" class="section"><h4 id="3355ae1a2bsp4"><b>3.4 策略与模板</b></h4><section id="dd08f80fcbok2" data-tag="tabbed-content-box" outputclass="tabbed-content-box" class="tabbed-content-box section"><section id="2b8af5c0902ls" class="section"><h2 id="c0fbe3d434ufr">记忆晋升环节</h2><section id="bdba5c1454ap7" class="section"><p id="ef89b0d234vyd"><b>配置晋升模板</b></p><ol id="555062ef5ds9b"><li id="6bd864b30ddiy"><p id="0a6c24774cxpy">进入<b>策略与模板</b>页面，单击<b>晋升模板</b>。</p></li><li id="58c33a32a3981"><p id="0eedf84c54q3q">选择成员后，单击<b>新建模板</b>。</p></li><li id="a89ce7b87aag0"><p id="0a9adf4137c74">在配置界面，输入<b>模板名称</b>，配置章节结构与内容，单击<b>确定</b>。</p></li></ol></section></section><section id="eb18388021iqh" class="section"><h2 id="0e5ce38730tun">知识评审环节</h2><section id="290b3c8d68jk6" class="section"><p id="edf81bf5c668p"><b>配置评审策略</b></p><ol id="c596b6cf713gj"><li id="8ca8f556e3ikh"><p id="00e759e75cid4">进入<b>策略与模板</b>页面，单击<b>评审策略</b>并选择<b>知识库</b>。</p></li><li id="868ed3ccb69ek"><p id="e340f9e0af31a">选择是否开启知识评审、重写文件自动入库、启用知识重写、自动入库阈值：</p><ol id="d9eacaa94fcuk"><li id="5f4fa6f882dj9"><p id="f0191b4230304">知识评审：开启后，当文件上传到知识库时，系统会自动进行质量评估、自矛盾检测、计算综合置信度，并做出入库决策。</p></li><li id="916041b1d44ol"><p id="9d985d14cfzjn">知识重写：开启后，文档置信度低于阈值时会触发智能重写，针对文件进行降噪、结构化、幻觉去重等操作。</p></li><li id="c2cec0e7eainf"><p id="de3e20a567m2f">重写文件自动入库：开启后，如果重写后的文件评分大于等于自动入库阈值，可自动入库。</p></li><li id="f4ac2bad95jbu"><p id="5d2156ac433z3">自动入库阈值：置信度大于或等于该阈值时，文件将自动入库并可被 Agent 召回。</p></li></ol></li><li id="1e04e9a5917wz"><p id="1c81990378v07">单击<b>保存配置</b>。</p></li></ol></section><section id="433bf157e8vje" class="section"><p id="2a11e5e9a5cf1"><b>配置重写模板</b></p><p id="bce57588cfsck">您可以为知识重写功能配置自定义的模板，规定文件重写的章节结构和撰写指引，AI<span class="help-letter-space"></span>会按模板生成重写内容。</p><ol id="1d91a8778eare"><li id="5e7137b2e7e5m"><p id="1d6d3d250dbae">进入<b>策略与模板</b>页面，单击<b>重写模板</b>并选择<b>知识库</b>。</p></li><li id="1c2e7f92c3s4u"><p id="9e51e247aa0dw">单击<b>新建模板</b>。在配置界面，输入<b>模板名称</b>，配置章节结构与内容，单击<b>确定</b>。</p></li></ol></section></section></section></section></section><section id="f120b38912nk7" class="section"><h3 id="515d62aaecl8o"><b>4. 用户管理</b></h3><p id="202bb1a24d0ve">用户管理页用于集中管理工作空间成员及权限、API Key<span class="help-letter-space"></span>凭证等信息。</p><ul id="a10805a7c5sgx" data-init-id="9bd275a6a8lke"><li id="c1151a344e35h"><p id="863e38aa0dwbe"><b>成员管理：</b>添加或删除工作空间成员。</p></li><li id="f581cfa45ey8p"><p id="25281c7d4825p"><b>API Key<span class="help-letter-space"></span>管理：</b>为各成员快速配置或吊销相应的<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API Key。</p></li></ul></section><section id="4f5e37c8e2z9w" class="section"><h3 id="4a75fe306cbt5"><b>5. 审计</b></h3><p id="e8a0b246fa46p">您可以在审计界面查看工作空间内的 API 调用和操作记录，支持按<span class="help-letter-space"></span>Action、时间或执行状态等条件筛选。</p></section></section><section id="section-related-relctx01" props="china" data-cond-props="china" class="section"><h2 id="h2-related-relctx02"><b>RDS ContextDB API<span class="help-letter-space"></span>参考</b></h2><p id="p-related-intro-relctx03">您可以通过<span class="help-letter-space"></span>OpenAPI<span class="help-letter-space"></span>操作<span class="help-letter-space"></span>ContextDB，相关接口如下：</p><table id="table-related-api-relctx04" tablewidth="100" tablecolswidth="40 60" autofit="true" class="table"><colgroup colwidth="0.8*" style="width:40.00%"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth="1.2*" style="width:60.00%"></colgroup><tbody class="tbody"><tr id="tr-api-header-relctx05"><td id="td-api-header-name-relctx06" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-header-name-relctx07"><b>API<span class="help-letter-space"></span>名称</b></p></td><td id="td-api-header-desc-relctx08" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-header-desc-relctx09"><b>描述</b></p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-cws-relctx10"><td id="td-api-cws-name-relctx11" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-cws-name-relctx12"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-createcontextdatabaseworkspace" id="a-api-cws-relctx13" title="" class="xref">CreateContextDatabaseWorkspace</a></p></td><td id="td-api-cws-desc-relctx14" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-cws-desc-relctx15">创建工作空间、首位成员和首把 API Key 的一次性引导流程。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-cak-relctx58"><td id="td-api-cak-name-relctx59" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-cak-name-relctx60"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-createcontextdatabaseapikey" id="a-api-cak-relctx61" title="" class="xref">CreateContextDatabaseApiKey</a></p></td><td id="td-api-cak-desc-relctx62" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-cak-desc-relctx63">创建 API Key。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-cme-relctx34"><td id="td-api-cme-name-relctx35" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-cme-name-relctx36"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-createcontextdatabasemember" id="a-api-cme-relctx37" title="" class="xref">CreateContextDatabaseMember</a></p></td><td id="td-api-cme-desc-relctx38" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-cme-desc-relctx39">创建成员。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-uws-relctx16"><td id="td-api-uws-name-relctx17" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-uws-name-relctx18"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-updatecontextdatabaseworkspace" id="a-api-uws-relctx19" title="" class="xref">UpdateContextDatabaseWorkspace</a></p></td><td id="td-api-uws-desc-relctx20" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-uws-desc-relctx21">更新工作空间。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-ume-relctx40"><td id="td-api-ume-name-relctx41" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-ume-name-relctx42"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-updatecontextdatabasemember" id="a-api-ume-relctx43" title="" class="xref">UpdateContextDatabaseMember</a></p></td><td id="td-api-ume-desc-relctx44" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-ume-desc-relctx45">更新成员。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-uak-relctx64"><td id="td-api-uak-name-relctx65" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-uak-name-relctx66"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-updatecontextdatabaseapikey" id="a-api-uak-relctx67" title="" class="xref">UpdateContextDatabaseApiKey</a></p></td><td id="td-api-uak-desc-relctx68" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-uak-desc-relctx69">更新<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API Key。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-lws-relctx22"><td id="td-api-lws-name-relctx23" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-lws-name-relctx24"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-listcontextdatabaseworkspaces" id="a-api-lws-relctx25" title="" class="xref">ListContextDatabaseWorkspaces</a></p></td><td id="td-api-lws-desc-relctx26" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-lws-desc-relctx27">列出工作空间。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-lme-relctx46"><td id="td-api-lme-name-relctx47" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-lme-name-relctx48"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-listcontextdatabasemembers" id="a-api-lme-relctx49" title="" class="xref">ListContextDatabaseMembers</a></p></td><td id="td-api-lme-desc-relctx50" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-lme-desc-relctx51">列出成员。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-lak-relctx70"><td id="td-api-lak-name-relctx71" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-lak-name-relctx72"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-listcontextdatabaseapikeys" id="a-api-lak-relctx73" title="" class="xref">ListContextDatabaseApiKeys</a></p></td><td id="td-api-lak-desc-relctx74" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-lak-desc-relctx75">列出<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API Key。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-dws-relctx28"><td id="td-api-dws-name-relctx29" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-dws-name-relctx30"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-deletecontextdatabaseworkspace" id="a-api-dws-relctx31" title="" class="xref">DeleteContextDatabaseWorkspace</a></p></td><td id="td-api-dws-desc-relctx32" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-dws-desc-relctx33">删除工作空间。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-dme-relctx52"><td id="td-api-dme-name-relctx53" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-dme-name-relctx54"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-deletecontextdatabasemember" id="a-api-dme-relctx55" title="" class="xref">DeleteContextDatabaseMember</a></p></td><td id="td-api-dme-desc-relctx56" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-dme-desc-relctx57">删除成员。</p></td></tr><tr id="tr-api-rak-relctx76"><td id="td-api-rak-name-relctx77" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-rak-name-relctx78"><a href="https://help.aliyun.com/zh/rds/apsaradb-rds-for-mysql/api-rdsai-2025-05-07-revokecontextdatabaseapikey" id="a-api-rak-relctx79" title="" class="xref">RevokeContextDatabaseApiKey</a></p></td><td id="td-api-rak-desc-relctx80" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="p-api-rak-desc-relctx81">吊销<span class="help-letter-space"></span>API Key。</p></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section id="91b39f4c13jnm" class="section"><h2 id="6f19cce809u3x"><b>附录：文件大小及格式限制</b></h2><p jc="left" id="3b7a756f24rg8" style="text-align:left">RDS ContextDB<span class="help-letter-space"></span>对上传至知识库的文件有大小及格式限制：</p><table id="84e4947662c8u" tablewidth="100" tablecolswidth="14.8 16.52 68.68" autofit="true" class="table"><colgroup colwidth="0.45*" style="width:14.80%"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth="0.5*" style="width:16.52%"></colgroup><colgroup colwidth="2.08*" style="width:68.68%"></colgroup><tbody class="tbody"><tr id="b57717ab3d7m8"><td id="0ac4453ad0gmm" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="7199593365nkx"><b>文件类型</b></p></td><td id="b1363c8f90eze" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="d1fe21af8caoj"><b>单个文件大小上限</b></p></td><td id="8f39a8d449oa7" rowspan="1" style="background-color:#e5e5e5" colspan="1"><p id="09e3c4ee6fsv2"><b>支持格式</b></p></td></tr><tr id="81627b481blkv"><td id="d7f9a0f27a5ch" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="8e96f46b6d2t4">纯文本</p></td><td id="8d6bb9055fmzc" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="236831a015e1r">20 MB</p></td><td id="44c277b4883lx" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><ul id="66201380e1nzz"><li id="aeea3866eaj6w"><p jc="left" id="cca841097cvhn" style="text-align:left">文本：txt、md、csv、tsv、log</p></li><li id="b87c0ca086s2e"><p id="8b41b0835do1q">标记/数据：json、xml、yaml、yml、html、htm</p></li><li id="6105a312b23mm"><p id="dacde2be89l52">代码：java、py、js、ts、jsx、tsx、go、rs、c、cpp、h、hpp、cs、rb、php、swift、kt、scala、lua、r、m</p></li><li id="d3a41c6e69gcw"><p id="cb45445e628gn">脚本：sh、bash、zsh、bat、ps1</p></li><li id="9f7118a7c379r"><p id="cba8ace9ba901">查询/接口：sql、graphql、proto</p></li><li id="775fdfc9bdx8z"><p id="a2fc985bd0s4z">样式：css、scss、less、sass</p></li><li id="14a8fcd45e1p1"><p id="9b8f104708dfv">框架：vue、svelte</p></li><li id="aae801f476lnt"><p id="0c5bda2cdfvfw">配置：toml、ini、cfg、conf、properties、env、dockerfile、makefile、cmake、gitignore、editorconfig</p></li></ul></td></tr><tr id="21a0b881a9x60"><td id="4d6fbaf780g4k" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="c580ac032drim">复杂文档/图片</p></td><td id="e232a0f681a4o" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="7684498cc4ow3">500 MB</p></td><td id="801afd5fd3pce" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><ul id="7c0425b8c6tqx"><li id="a0cb71b8039ou"><p jc="left" id="ad7e0ddf7c17t" style="text-align:left">复杂文档：pdf、doc、docx、ppt、pptx、xls、xlsx、epub</p></li><li id="65e2b200d0u79"><p id="5379d0f3caft6">图片：png、jpg、jpeg、gif、bmp、webp、tiff、tif、svg</p></li></ul></td></tr><tr id="d10121d57bv0u"><td id="de73359577bwd" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="88ffb2d702xdy">音频</p></td><td id="9d9c4d0c8faxe" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="49b63c7551gsw">10 MB/5<span class="help-letter-space"></span>分钟</p></td><td id="b502176d2a1kn" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="9a526734e94dt">mp3、wav、flac、ogg、m4a、aac、wma</p></td></tr><tr id="1c0dad6f0f2o6"><td id="5683ede7acisq" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="bf4929dbcaqls">视频</p></td><td id="7fdfdedaf4ubs" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="f904ad8483xez">2 GB</p></td><td id="2419786567hxz" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p id="663dccbbf2rx9">mp4、avi、mov、mkv、webm、flv、wmv、3gp、mpeg、mpg</p></td></tr></tbody></table></section></div></main>

